        "page_work": {
          "__typename": "page_work",
          "text": "<p><strong>STAGECREW</strong> is an intentionally compact, international design studio with a fierce collaborative spirit, working in cultural spaces and beyond. We specialize in holistic visual identities, digital experiences, and brand alignment, always with great care and a deep respect for those we work with. We are particularly inspired by the tactile properties of physical objects and spaces that surround us, often drawing upon these natural motifs and references in our output.</p>",
          "seo_settings": null
